<h2>The Verdict: Is an Under Desk Elliptical as Good as Walking?</h2>
<p>Is an under desk elliptical as good as walking? Per minute, walking is the harder and more complete activity. Per day, an under desk elliptical can match or beat a short walk for calories because it fits into hours of work time you would otherwise spend sitting still. It cannot replace walking's weight-bearing and balance benefits, so the smartest approach is to pedal while you work and still walk when you can.</p>
<p>If you sit most of the day and want an easy way to move more, a quiet seated elliptical such as the [[amazon:cubii-jr2|Cubii JR2]] is a good place to start. If you want to know whether it counts as a real workout, read <a href="/is-an-under-desk-elliptical-good-exercise/">is an under desk elliptical good exercise</a>.</p>
